[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12181.19, "timestamp": "03:23:01", "text": "1つ目、いいえ。 ２、３、５。ああ、あと少しだったのに。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12184.389, "timestamp": "03:23:04", "text": "6と言ってもよかったかもしれません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12186.469, "timestamp": "03:23:06", "text": "いや、いや。去年の学期と同じように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12188.63, "timestamp": "03:23:08", "text": "7つのうち1つをなんとか発表できた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12192.95, "timestamp": "03:23:12", "text": "今。おお、男よ。待って、今何年？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12193.704, "timestamp": "03:23:13", "author": "@AerinViolet", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UKawanVvntNiAwz6RWv6wPk_S8YwApvPcCfLApO-du_RbQRIPGtzJ5FTt1DCNmZFJWc_2vxlqw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ssIfY7OFG5OykQOpn4CQCw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12195.75, "timestamp": "03:23:15", "text": "2番目か3番目か？ 3年目。ええと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12198.15, "timestamp": "03:23:18", "text": "来月の試験に向けて。もしそうなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12199.59, "timestamp": "03:23:19", "text": "以上で、私は３年生を修了し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12202.51, "timestamp": "03:23:22", "text": "最終学年に入ります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12204.99, "timestamp": "03:23:24", "text": "ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12208.87, "timestamp": "03:23:28", "text": "こんにちは。もちろんです。ああ、こんにちは。こんにちは。どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12211.429, "timestamp": "03:23:31", "text": "何をしているの？ウォリアーは録画していません。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12213.99, "timestamp": "03:23:33", "text": "もう生きていたくない。おお、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12216.271, "timestamp": "03:23:36", "author": "@AerinViolet", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/UKawanVvntNiAwz6RWv6wPk_S8YwApvPcCfLApO-du_RbQRIPGtzJ5FTt1DCNmZFJWc_2vxlqw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I am good"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12216.71, "timestamp": "03:23:36", "text": "それに関連するものについて知っている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12218.389, "timestamp": "03:23:38", "text": "イベント。たった2年くらいのことだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12221.429, "timestamp": "03:23:41", "text": "あるいは、そんな感じ。 O"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12222.87, "timestamp": "03:23:42", "text": "だって、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12224.87, "timestamp": "03:23:44", "text": "1 つの概念を学ぶ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12226.469, "timestamp": "03:23:46", "text": "大学生活全体を通して。あなたはこう思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12229.64, "timestamp": "03:23:49", "text": "あれこれと少しずつ学んでいる。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12231.19, "timestamp": "03:23:51", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12232.87, "timestamp": "03:23:52", "text": "あのね？見せてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12236.15, "timestamp": "03:23:56", "text": "私が試みたことをあなたに伝えます。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12237.67, "timestamp": "03:23:57", "text": "ええ、その主題を読めばわかるでしょう"}]